# The Huntsman's Redemption {2}{G} (Saga): "I - Create a 3/3 green Beast creature token. II - You may sacrifice a creature. If you do,
# search your library for a creature or basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle. III - Up to two target creatures
# each get +2/+2 and gain trample until end of turn." Turn 1: the Saga (chapter I: a Beast) with an Elvish Mystic beside it. Turn 3,
# chapter II: any creature of Bot1's may be sacrificed (the Beast or the Mystic, not a Mox), and Bot1 gives up the Mystic, then the
# search finds only a creature or basic land: not an instant, not the nonbasic land Taiga. It finds Grizzly Bears, revealed (Bot2 sees
# it), puts it in hand and shuffles once. Turn 5, chapter III: two creatures are targeted (not a Mox), the Beast and the Bears become
# 5/5 and 4/4 tramplers, and are 3/3 and 2/2 with no trample again on Bot2's turn.

